    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaper Recons</strong> is a fast-paced, third-person arcade shooter that throws you into the heart of an abandoned research facility teeming with the undead. Lock and load as you battle through relentless waves of enemies in a test of reflexes and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage a variety of enemy types\u2014from quick, one-hit threats to explosive variants\u2014each adding intensity to the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully traversable map as you fight to survive. Collect powerful weapons, grab ability pick-ups, and gain the edge as the difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in. Wipe them out. Reap the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/8700b25ce7c19b8b23141cd1b24f2d98.avif?t=1753650624\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/cfca4249f43c2440d88fcc53cb030a3c.avif?t=1753650624\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/f96e6e87238efc757d00a32d59972752.avif?t=1753650624\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaper Recons</strong> is a fast-paced, third-person arcade shooter that throws you into the heart of an abandoned research facility teeming with the undead. Lock and load as you battle through relentless waves of enemies in a test of reflexes and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage a variety of enemy types\u2014from quick, one-hit threats to explosive variants\u2014each adding intensity to the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully traversable map as you fight to survive. Collect powerful weapons, grab ability pick-ups, and gain the edge as the difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in. Wipe them out. Reap the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/8700b25ce7c19b8b23141cd1b24f2d98.avif?t=1753650624\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/cfca4249f43c2440d88fcc53cb030a3c.avif?t=1753650624\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/f96e6e87238efc757d00a32d59972752.avif?t=1753650624\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
